    {
      "id": "checks",
      "title": "What to check first to cut the wait?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Log `cache=hit` or `cache=miss` to tell the request paths apart.",
            "Measure GET, SQL, and SET latency separately, and fix the slowest one first.",
            "Check SQL indexes and the query plan; before switching to an asynchronous write-back, design recovery for failed writes."
          ],
